1
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:14,180

2
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,550

3
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:21,310

4
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:35,610

5
00:00:45,330 --> 00:00:46,580
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stand down!

6
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:50,670
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's over. Let him through.

7
00:00:57,890 --> 00:00:59,140
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where's Hal?

8
00:01:03,230 --> 00:01:04,520
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's at the motel.

9
00:01:21,870 --> 00:01:23,200
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you need a doctor?

10
00:01:24,870 --> 00:01:25,870
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.

11
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:29,630
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You all right?

12
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:34,550
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How many dead?

13
00:01:37,050 --> 00:01:38,140
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know yet.

14
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:40,850
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's bad.

15
00:01:45,180 --> 00:01:46,480
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was it worth it?

16
00:01:55,190 --> 00:01:56,190
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?

17
00:01:58,740 --> 00:02:00,620
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's the same thing I asked John.

18
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:06,250
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What will the Guardians say?

19
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:08,500
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I failed to notify 'em,

20
00:02:08,580 --> 00:02:11,000
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and I put a lot of people's lives in danger for...

21
00:02:13,750 --> 00:02:15,130
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}selfish reasons.

22
00:02:19,260 --> 00:02:22,890
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that there won't be any pushback in any court that convicts me

23
00:02:23,390 --> 00:02:25,020
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}of reckless endangerment.

24
00:02:27,850 --> 00:02:30,560
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of a nice, clean solution to their problem...

25
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:32,860
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}of me.

26
00:02:36,030 --> 00:02:37,190
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.

27
00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:39,280
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You told me.

28
00:02:40,530 --> 00:02:42,700
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't leave town, whatever happened next...

29
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,240
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}was on me.

30
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,250
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.

31
00:02:48,330 --> 00:02:49,580
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is.

32
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:53,210
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I can still feel bad about being right.

33
00:03:06,350 --> 00:03:10,270

34
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:15,480
